    <body>
      <trans-unit id="HDI_Title" resname="HDI_Title">
        <source>Set up list box auto row height?</source>
        <target>リストボックスの自動行高を設定しますか?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI_Info" resname="HDI_Info">
        <source>4D View Pro feature</source>
        <target>4D View Pro機能</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="BtnClose" resname="BtnClose">
        <source>Close</source>
        <target>閉じる</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ErrorViewProMain" resname="ErrorViewProMain">
        <source>Sorry, this “How do I” (HDI) example demonstrates a 4D View Pro feature.</source>
        <target>申し訳ございませんが、この“How do I”(HDI)サンプルは4D View Pro機能を示すものです。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ErrorViewProSub" resname="ErrorViewProSub">
        <source>You must have a valid 4D View Pro license to continue.</source>
        <target>続行するには有効な4D View Proライセンスが必要です。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ErrorWriteProMain" resname="ErrorWriteProMain">
        <source>Sorry, this “How do I” (HDI) example demonstrates a 4D Write Pro feature.</source>
        <target>申し訳ございませんが、この“How do I”(HDI)サンプルは4D Write Pro機能を示すものです。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ErrorWriteProSub" resname="ErrorWriteProSub">
        <source>You must have a valid 4D Write Pro license to continue.</source>
        <target>続行するには有効な4D Write Proライセンスが必要です。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatTruncatedCentered" resname="HDI2_PictFormatTruncatedCentered">
        <source>Truncated centered (*)</source>
        <target>中央切り詰め (*)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFit" resname="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFit">
        <source>Scaled to fit</source>
        <target>サイズに合わせて拡大縮小</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatOnBackground" resname="HDI2_PictFormatOnBackground">
        <source>On background</source>
        <target>背景に配置</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatTruncatedNonCentered" resname="HDI2_PictFormatTruncatedNonCentered">
        <source>Truncated non centered (*)</source>
        <target>非中央切り詰め (*)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFitProportional" resname="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFitProportional">
        <source>Scaled to fit proportional (*)</source>
        <target>比例縮小 (*)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFitPropCentered" resname="HDI2_PictFormatScaledToFitPropCentered">
        <source>Scaled to fit prop centered (*)</source>
        <target>中央比例縮小 (*)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_PictFormatReplicated" resname="HDI2_PictFormatReplicated">
        <source>Replicated</source>
        <target>反復</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="HDI2_RowUnitLines" resname="HDI2_RowUnitLines">
